Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:43.44,Hdr,,0,0,0,,November 2, 2008 - Tenno Sho (Autumn)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:02.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Round the final turn and into the straight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:05.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Daiwa Scarlet leads - Daiwa Scarlet in front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:07.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Asakusa Kings is coming after her
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:10.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,And outside him, Deep Sky is improving
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:12.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Further out still, Vodka - Vodka is coming
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.90,0:00:17.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,A battle of the big three - Daiwa Scarlet leads, Vodka closing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:20.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Deep Sky in between - and Company is charging too
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:23.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Not far to go - Daiwa Scarlet in front on the inside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:25.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Vodka outside, Company in between, then Deep Sky
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.70,0:00:30.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Two together up front - Vodka or Daiwa Scarlet - they hit the line together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:35.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Which one? A clash of two great fillies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:38.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Will it be Vodka or Daiwa Scarlet?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.50,0:00:42.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Who gets the verdict? The finish of the century!